      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient is reported in whom exercise induced reversible ischemic left anterior fascicular block and far advanced right bundle branch block. Master's two step exercise test for pre-operative check-up revealed significant ST elevation in leads V1-5, negative U waves in leads V3-5 and fascicular blocks with retrosternal anginal chest pain. Long acting nitrate and nicorandil relieved the fascicular blocks."},
